WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.200
So this is August the 2nd, 1922 in volume 14.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.660
"The heading is lightness to Jesus in his greatest pain,

3
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.200
the abandonment of the divinity in his sufferings."

4
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.480
This is a very important thing that's going to be given to us now.

5
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.080
Louisa said, "Finding myself and my usual state,

6
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.920
I saw myself all confused and as though separated from my sweet Jesus,

7
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.920
to the point that as he came, I said to him,

8
00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.840
'My love, how things have changed from me.'"

9
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.460
She's been saying that since volume 2.

10
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.920
"Before I used to feel so identified with you

11
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.560
that I felt no division between you and me.

12
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:53.080
And in the very pains I suffered, you were with me."

13
00:00:53.080 --> 00:01:01.200
Now, Louisa's problem is that life changes.

14
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.800
I presume you're not the person you were 10 years ago.

15
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.120
And the difficulty we have is to identify

16
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.320
that the Lord has brought about a particular change

17
00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.400
and what it means and where it's going.

18
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.520
That's what Louisa is actually dealing with.

19
00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:22.720
Okay, so the subject is really discernment, all right?

20
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.240
And she said, "You used to be with me also in the pains."

21
00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:29.040
Now, it's the complete opposite.

22
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.040
"And I suffer. I feel separated from you."

23
00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.520
Now, she's one with him in the divine will and it's permanent.

24
00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.400
So how can she feel separated?

25
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.960
That's what's going to be explained to her.

26
00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.440
Okay. "I feel separated from you.

27
00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.720
And if I see you before me or inside me,

28
00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.160
it is the appearance of a judge who condemns me

29
00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.920
to the penalty that is to death.

30
00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.000
And you no longer take part in the pains

31
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.760
that you yourself give me.

32
00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.960
And yet you say to me, "Rise more and more."

33
00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.920
She said, "While I am descending."

34
00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:09.720
So here's a title for the next paragraph,

35
00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:15.480
"The Interior Passion, Spiritual Suffering."

36
00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.320
Now, spiritual suffering is very difficult

37
00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.360
and it's also difficult to name

38
00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:25.360
and to really know what's going on.

39
00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:28.520
So Jesus interrupted me and said,

40
00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:32.320
"My daughter, how you are deceiving yourself."

41
00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.760
Because this isn't the reality.

42
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.640
"This is happening because you accepted

43
00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.520
and I marked in you the deaths and the pains

44
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.640
which I suffered for every creature."

45
00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.960
So she's going through something that he went through.

46
00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:55.400
"My humanity, too, found itself in these painful conditions.

47
00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.840
It was inseparable from my divinity.

48
00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:04.080
And since my divinity was untouchable by pains,

49
00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:07.400
nor capable of suffering any shadow of pain,

50
00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:11.360
my humanity found itself alone in suffering.

51
00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:15.120
While my divinity was only the spectator of the pains

52
00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.800
and the deaths which I suffered."

53
00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.240
Now, beside that, I wanted to put Matthew 27.46.

54
00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:26.880
Matthew 27.46, "My God, my God, why have you deserted me?"

55
00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.560
Because that was the moment when the divinity

56
00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.480
left his humanity to take the brunt, okay?

57
00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:38.840
Even more, the divinity was my inexorable judge

58
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:45.000
who wanted to be paid the penalty for each pain of each creature.

59
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.760
That's the bit that's almost impossible to take on board.

60
00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.280
Each pain of each creature.

61
00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:56.400
"Oh, how my humanity trembled," he said.

62
00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.360
"I remained crushed before the supreme light and majesty

63
00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:03.680
in seeing myself covered with the sins of all.

64
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.120
That is the meaning of Louisa feeling separated.

65
00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.200
That if she's making reparation for the sins

66
00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.320
and the pains of human beings,

67
00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.960
then she's standing before divine justice.

68
00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.600
And there is the gulf between divine justice and sin."

69
00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.960
Okay?

70
00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.880
I should say between God and sin,

71
00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.160
so divine justice has got to be appeased.

72
00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:29.880
But that was exactly the position of Jesus on the cross.

73
00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:33.520
So he said, "In seeing myself covered with the sins of all

74
00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:37.320
and with the pains and deaths that each one deserved."

75
00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.600
Okay.

76
00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.600
That's why he said, "I remained crushed."

77
00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:44.800
"It was the greatest pain of my life,

78
00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:48.920
that while I was one with the divinity and inseparable from it,

79
00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.880
in the pains I remained alone and as though apart."

80
00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:58.560
So he stands in the breach between divine justice and human sin.

81
00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.760
Okay. And he's got to stand there.

82
00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:04.400
So standing in the breach is Sam 106.

83
00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:10.160
I can't remember the verse right now,

84
00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:14.120
but I gave you that reference before, but it's Sam 106.

85
00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:19.280
And you're told in Sam 106 that if Moses hadn't stood in the breach,

86
00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:22.120
that divine justice would have wiped out the people.

87
00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:26.960
Okay. And that intercession of Moses was on Mount Sinai.

88
00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:35.120
"So since I have called you to my likeness," Jesus said,

89
00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:39.040
"what is the wonder if while you feel me inside of you

90
00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.080
and you see me as the spectator of your pains,

91
00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.800
which I myself inflict upon you,

92
00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.320
and you feel as though separated from me."

93
00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.360
So it seems a contradiction until it is explained.

94
00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.880
"Yet your pain is nothing but the shadow of mine."

95
00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.160
Now, her pain is nearly killing her,

96
00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.320
but that's because we're tiny little creatures

97
00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:02.440
and then he is the great one.

98
00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.920
"And just as my humanity was never separated from the divinity,

99
00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:11.840
so I assure you that you are never separated from me."

100
00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:15.040
In other words, the office you are carrying out

101
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:19.280
does not affect your personal union with me.

102
00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.320
Is that okay?

103
00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:29.640
So let's say you have taken marriage vows

104
00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:34.840
and you have a particular job to do in an office

105
00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.240
or you're running a business or whatever,

106
00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:42.240
it doesn't reflect on your relationship with your spouse.

107
00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.040
Your relationship with your spouse is one thing

108
00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.680
and the job you're doing is another.

109
00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:50.120
Louisa's being shown that.

110
00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.560
"So I assure you that you're never separated from me.

111
00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.640
These are the effects that you feel.

112
00:06:55.640 --> 00:07:00.600
But then more than ever do I form one single thing with you

113
00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:04.000
because she's doing what Jesus did as well.

114
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.400
So therefore have courage and faithfulness and don't fear.

115
00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:12.880
It's hard not to fear when you're suffering desperately."

116
00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:20.720
So August the 6th, 1922, my heading for this is God's ecosystem.

117
00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:24.320
And the whole subject here is balance.

118
00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:28.760
If we're the way God wants us to be, everything will be balanced.

119
00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.040
Everything in the universe is balanced, okay?

120
00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:36.320
And when we don't interfere with this balance,

121
00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:41.440
everything that God has created will carry out its function, okay?

122
00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.440
So Louisa said, "I felt all immersed in the holy will of God

123
00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.400
and my sweet Jesus on coming told me,

124
00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.480
'My daughter, all things have equal weight for me.

125
00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:55.840
This is the balance in creation.

126
00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.960
The weight of heaven is equal for me to that of earth.

127
00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:04.240
My will contains perfect balance.'"

128
00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:10.480
So one of the things, this is one of the keys, okay,

129
00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:14.200
whereby you will know if you're going forward in the divine will

130
00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:19.120
because people at a very early stage in a religious life

131
00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.520
can be quite unbalanced about things like they'll do so many religious things

132
00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.880
that they'll neglect their families, do you know what I mean?

133
00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.600
That's unbalanced.

134
00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.120
Now, if you are really in God's will, everything is balanced.

135
00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:36.400
And the more we go into God's will,

136
00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:39.160
the more balance that actually comes into us.

137
00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.200
And actually, the strange thing is, the less religious you look,

138
00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.680
that's the strange thing.

139
00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:48.880
You can look fierce religious at a very early stage.

140
00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:54.480
You know, do you remember that CD we all got a couple of years ago,

141
00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:58.480
you know, the children talking about the gospel

142
00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.560
and one of the children, she was only six.

143
00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:04.760
She said that John the Baptist was fierce awful holy.

144
00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.720
You remember that?

145
00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.320
Give up your old sins, yeah.

146
00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:14.680
Now, people can look fierce awful holy at the very beginning of the religious life

147
00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.880
and when they are very advanced, they can look perfectly normal

148
00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:21.000
and not look religious at all.

149
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:25.200
And they won't talk religion, but the ones at the beginning will talk nothing else.

150
00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:31.920
So you'll be able to find out where they're at, you know, it's very interesting.

151
00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:36.960
You've got too much experience in the higher stages to need to talk about it all the time.

152
00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:41.120
In the lower stages, you're only getting your feet into the water.

153
00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:46.760
So balance is the big thing here in this text, okay?

154
00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.920
So my will contains perfect balance.

155
00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.920
So balance brings about order.

156
00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:56.560
Now, even the title of your book tells you that we're being drawn back

157
00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.960
into the order into which we were created.

158
00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.760
Is that right?

159
00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:08.480
So if everything inside of us interiorly isn't brought more and more into order

160
00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:12.480
and balance, we're not making progress in divine will.

161
00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:16.920
So he said balance brings regime.

162
00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:20.920
Now, a regime is a system of rules or a discipline, okay?

163
00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:24.560
So it's the divine discipline that comes into us.

164
00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.600
Utility, that's usefulness, okay?

165
00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:32.120
And harmony, now balance and harmony go together.

166
00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:36.760
All things harmonize together as if they were one single thing.

167
00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:41.560
Order brings equality, equality brings likeness.

168
00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:46.600
And this is why there's so much harmony, order and likeness in the three divine persons

169
00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.360
and they're interdependent.

170
00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:53.680
And these are all aspects of interdependence in the divine order.

171
00:10:53.680 --> 00:11:00.160
And so harmony, order and likeness in the three divine persons, okay?

172
00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:04.280
And all created things are in perfect harmony if they weren't,

173
00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.160
we would have shocking disasters.

174
00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:13.000
One is the support and the strength and the life of the other.

175
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:19.280
If just one created thing, dis-harmonized, all the others would tremble and end up in ruin.

176
00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.360
That's why I call it God's ecosystem.

177
00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:26.640
Everything is dependent on everything else and everything needs everything else.

178
00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:32.680
And when everything is in its correct order, it all works, okay?

179
00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.440
Only man moved away from us.

180
00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:42.200
And you know from the higher volumes that when Adam moved away from this divine order

181
00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:49.120
that all heaven and earth shook and the disasters that came out of it was unbelievable.

182
00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:56.120
And to only man moved away from us from the balance of our will.

183
00:11:56.120 --> 00:12:01.960
Oh how man tumbled and from the highest place he fell into the deepest abyss.

184
00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:06.800
That's like falling off Mount Everest.

185
00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:13.160
In spite of my redemption, not all of the human family has returned to its original state.

186
00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:16.960
So this means that lots of people have not actually benefited from redemption

187
00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.920
because they've done nothing about it.

188
00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.320
Unfortunately I might know names.

189
00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:30.640
This means that the gravest thing is to withdraw from the balance of our will.

190
00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:36.040
Now if you actually just ring the number of times the word balance is used

191
00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:41.400
in this entire text, you'll realize what he's trying to get across.

192
00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:46.760
So the most serious thing then is to withdraw from the balance of the divine will.

193
00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:53.480
It means hurling oneself into chaos, into disorder and into the abyss of all evils.

194
00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:59.560
Now if you go to the book of Genesis chapter 1 and verses 1 and 2 and 3,

195
00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.680
you're told on verse 1 that God created everything.

196
00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:05.200
Verse 2 you're told there was terrible chaos around the place.

197
00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.240
Now why was there terrible chaos?

198
00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:10.960
It was because of the rebellion of the angels.

199
00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:18.760
And then the next thing is God created light to start putting everything into order.

200
00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:25.200
Now my daughter, this is why I have called you in a special way into this balance of my will.

201
00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:34.320
So that as you live in it, you may come to balance all the work of deranged humanity.

202
00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:38.600
Now deranged means it's all out of balance.

203
00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:47.560
By living in my will, you will balance yourself and you will be in order and in perfect harmony with us.

204
00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:51.920
And with all things created by us.

205
00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:59.360
So since you harmonize everything, we will feel you flowing in the sphere of our will,

206
00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:03.720
which of course Adam was before he fell.

207
00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:10.200
Giving us the order and the harmony of all the intelligences, words, works and steps of all.

208
00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.920
So there's your substitution and reparation for everybody.

209
00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:21.880
We will constitute your act in our will as the rulers of all the others.

210
00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.880
That's to enable the rest of humanity to come back.

211
00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.880
And we will make up for the chaos of unfortunate humanity.

212
00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:36.080
Now you've had several words there given for humanity that humanity moved away from the balance,

213
00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:40.120
went into total disorder, deranged chaos.

214
00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:41.720
OK.

215
00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:49.960
So each act of yours will be the mark of the order which we will receive in the name of all the others.

216
00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:53.880
Now notice that the prayer is in the name of all.

217
00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:58.920
You have much to do in our will, because she was the first to come back.

218
00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:06.800
You will be like a queen and will bring us all conquests and all harmonies.

219
00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:13.520
Our will will administer to you all that is necessary so that you can make up for all.

220
00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.600
You desire it, I do it, OK?

221
00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:23.880
And fill the void of the balance of the human will which received so much harm in withdrawing

222
00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.600
from the balance of our divine will.

223
00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.960
Anybody count to the word balance?

224
00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.600
[INAUDIBLE]

225
00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:35.480
There's about 12 of them, OK?

226
00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:40.320
So in other words, you're being told this is a major issue.

227
00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:44.960
But it's also a key to discerning how we're doing.

228
00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:51.560
So if we still have points of imbalance in us, there's work to be done to bring us back

229
00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.080
into that balance.

230
00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.440
That OK?

231
00:15:54.440 --> 00:16:01.000
So August the 12th, 1922.

232
00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:05.400
I want to give you a heading for this, and it's the thread of the human will.

233
00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.800
The thread of the human will.

234
00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:14.240
And so while you're thinking of the thread of the human will, I want to remind you of something

235
00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.800
I've given to you several times before.

236
00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:22.200
And it is that John of the Cross gave the story of a bird that's tied to a tree.

237
00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.960
And it could be tied with a rope or a thread.

238
00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:29.320
But it's much more tragic to be tied with a thread, OK?

239
00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:36.680
So I just write on the page to remind myself the bird enslaved by a thread.

240
00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.680
And you see, that's where we're going to be told.

241
00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:47.120
I felt oppressed and in pain, Louisa said, in such a way that only my sweet Jesus can

242
00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.600
know.

