So it isn't just God that chastises human beings, human beings chastise each other in

912
01:13:13.800 --> 01:13:17.440
the most awful way.

913
01:13:17.440 --> 01:13:24.200
My love which runs towards them to cover them with graces is rejected and it turns into

914
01:13:24.200 --> 01:13:26.840
fire to strike them.

915
01:13:26.840 --> 01:13:32.600
Therefore humanity finds itself between two fires, the fire of heaven and the fire of

916
01:13:32.600 --> 01:13:40.680
hell in the fire of war or in the fire of chastisement.

917
01:13:40.680 --> 01:13:46.960
There are so many evils that these fires are about to join while the pains that I make

918
01:13:46.960 --> 01:13:54.120
you suffer flow in between these two fires to prevent them from uniting.

919
01:13:54.120 --> 01:14:01.200
If I didn't do this everything would be over for humanity, that was 1922, you and I would

920
01:14:01.200 --> 01:14:05.920
