921
01:14:05.920 --> 01:14:07.920
Therefore let me do it.

922
01:14:07.920 --> 01:14:16.920
I will give you strength and I will be with you, that's your Joshua 1-5.

923
01:14:16.920 --> 01:14:20.880
Now you do know that the powers that be are building up to World War III.

924
01:14:20.880 --> 01:14:26.040
And what we've just read applies to World War III as well.

925
01:14:26.040 --> 01:14:32.520
So in the next paragraph, while he was saying this he breathed it into me again and I unable

926
01:14:32.520 --> 01:14:37.760
to take any more, prayed him to touch me with his hands in order to sustain me and give

927
01:14:37.760 --> 01:14:39.520
me strength.

928
01:14:39.520 --> 01:14:45.040
And Jesus did touch me taking my heart in his hands and squeezing it so tightly that

929
01:14:45.040 --> 01:14:50.100
he alone knows how he made me feel because if you squeeze the heart very tight you feel

930
01:14:50.100 --> 01:14:53.460
as if you're going to take your last breath.

931
01:14:53.460 --> 01:14:58.960
But not content with this, he clashed my throat strongly with his hands.

932
01:14:58.960 --> 01:15:00.460
Suffocation, okay.

933
01:15:00.460 --> 01:15:06.120
And to the point that I felt the bones and the nerves in my throat snap, that's something

934
01:15:06.120 --> 01:15:08.560
else, isn't it?

935
01:15:08.560 --> 01:15:11.000
So as to feel suffocation.

936
01:15:11.000 --> 01:15:16.080
Then after he left me in that position for some time, all tenderness he came back and

937
01:15:16.080 --> 01:15:24.520
he said courage, such is the state in which the present generation finds itself suffocating

938
01:15:24.520 --> 01:15:25.520
with evil.

939
01:15:25.520 --> 01:15:28.960
Isn't that absolutely unbelievable?

940
01:15:28.960 --> 01:15:38.680
And in all classes, the rich and the poor, the religious and the lay, the passions that

941
01:15:38.680 --> 01:15:45.280
dominated are such and so many that the creatures are drowned by their own passions and by the

942
01:15:45.280 --> 01:15:51.280
ugliest vices, 1922.

943
01:15:51.280 --> 01:15:57.160
The rot, the mud, is so much that it is about to submerge them.

944
01:15:57.160 --> 01:16:02.720
This is why I wanted to make you suffer the pain of choking your throat.

945
01:16:02.720 --> 01:16:10.120
This is the pain of extreme excesses, isn't that awful?

946
01:16:10.120 --> 01:16:16.380
And no longer able to bear the sight of humanity suffocated by its own evils, I wanted a reparation

947
01:16:16.380 --> 01:16:18.280
