966
01:17:47.360 --> 01:17:51.760
Now I've read that from another mystic as well, that the battering against the cross

967
01:17:51.760 --> 01:17:55.920
actually terrified his, even his enemies.

968
01:17:55.920 --> 01:18:03.040
Because they realized he had to be in the extreme pain to crash against the cross and

969
01:18:03.040 --> 01:18:10.600
every crash of course opened the wounds in his hands and feet all the time, all the time.

970
01:18:10.600 --> 01:18:16.360
To the extent that even the enemies were terrorized, okay, it's here as well, therefore I repeat

971
01:18:16.360 --> 01:18:23.960
to you, courage, my will will give you strength in everything.

972
01:18:23.960 --> 01:18:25.620
I think we should stop there.
